ASSIGNMENTS

Choose one of the following:
Barbarian: You live on a primitive world without the
benefits of technology.
Wanderer: You are a space bum, living hand-to-mouth
in slums and spaceports across the galaxy.
Scavenger: You work as a belter (asteroid miner) or on
a salvage crew.

